# Only send the files needed at runtime to the build context
*
!pro_tes/
!LICENSE
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
# Run by the image build to list the requirements to install
!scripts/image_requirements.py

# Exclude caches and local files within the included paths
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info

# Exclude secrets also within the included paths (e.g., `pro_tes/.env`):
# files of the build context land in a layer of the image
**/.[Ee][Nn][Vv]*
!**/.env.example
**/.env.example/**
**/*.[Pp][Ee][Mm]
**/*.[Kk][Ee][Yy]
**/*.[Pp]12
**/*.[Pp][Ff][Xx]
